Not quite sure of what you did, but if you're comfortable with regedit, 
take a look under the "HKEY_CURRENT_USER/Console" key. There should be 
an entry for your Nethack window with your saved settings. The Console 
key itself has all the defaults under it.

I changed the blue color to be brighter, also. So, the only ColorTable 
entry under the Nethack window key for me is "ColorTable01," with the 
value 0x00c00000 instead of 0x00800000.

Hope this helps.

